# Weavra source builds are local by default.
# No hosted account, relay, analytics tenant, updater, store, or publication
# infrastructure is configured for this product. Copying this file enables none.
# Do not place server-side credentials in public build configuration.

# Optional product home; default: ~/.weavra
# WEAVRA_HOME=/absolute/path/to/weavra

# Optional app-only home; default: <WEAVRA_HOME or ~/.weavra>/app
# WEAVRA_APP_HOME=/absolute/path/to/weavra/app

# Direct local servers, explicit providers, SSH, and Tailscale remain available.
# Historical T3CODE hosted-service variables do not enable Weavra services.
